{"version":1,"key":"card:629","content":{"id":629,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"f06c7344-34b1-437a-821a-624f41622ea7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当通过鼠标或者键盘聚焦到可聚焦的元素上时，会出现焦点指示器（一般是外轮廓）以响应用户已聚焦到该元素，但是这个样式很丑，很多时候我们不想要这个样式，就会把这个外轮廓去掉，但是这样对无障碍人士就不友好，如果说他只能通过键盘访问聚焦的元素，如果没有这个视觉上的提示，它无法知道自己是否成功聚焦到了该元素，不知道自己所处的位置，并进一步访问，所以我们希望当通过鼠标等手段进行聚焦时，可以把聚焦的框隐藏，但是基于无障碍的手段如键盘聚焦时，依旧显示这个外边框。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e51f7793-2f6f-40ec-a4a6-3291c0562743.png","alt":"","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_e51f7793-2f6f-40ec-a4a6-3291c0562743.png","width":581.8181692076126,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"918eca6c-46ee-4503-9f17-a9ab3d5fc785","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"75f83991-db86-4c0a-b00d-7abd1fada13e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"基于此背景下，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":":focus-visible"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 应运而生。它可以区分出是通过鼠标还是键盘访问的聚焦元素，如果是通过键盘（如 Tab 键）访问的，那么就会匹配上 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":":focus-visible"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，如果是通过鼠标则不会"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"CSS","uuid":"44908938-df42-4549-b900-512ed0c0fd0e","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"644c865e-9773-4598-abe6-c38b3ed3aae5","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"/* 只有当用户通过键盘导航到这个按钮时，才会出现蓝色的轮廓 */\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid dodgerblue;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n/* 鼠标点击时，不显示轮廓 */\nbutton:focus:not(:focus-visible) {\n  outline: none;\n}","collabId":"1427c9c1-d094-4ccb-97f6-a7bd2e10ed78","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["CSS"],"createTime":1758722443567,"updateTime":1758975378498,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1758975378498}}